  "text": "Copyright \u00a9 International Maritime Organization 2022 (Sales number IC656E)Guidelines for the Implementation of MARPOL Annex V 2017 Edition Supplement October 2022 Since the publication of Guidelines for the Implementation of MARPOL Annex V , 2017 edition, the Marine Environment Protection Committee (MEPC) has adopted resolution MEPC.314(74), which entered into force on 1 October 2020. The amendments to MARPOL Annex V presented in this supplement have been incorporated in MARPOL Consolidated Edition 2022 . Resolution MEPC.314(74) Amendments to MARPOL Annexes I, II and V Electronic record books MARPOL ANNEX V Regulations for the prevention of pollution by garbage from ships Regulation 1* Definitions 1 A n ew paragraph 19 is added as follows: \u201c19 E lectronic Record Book means a device or system, approved by the Administration, used to electronically record the required entries for discharges, transfers and other operations as required under this Annex in lieu of a hard copy record book.\u201d ",
